/*!
\page page_strhicfrawhit StRHICfRawHit

\brief Raw ADC, TDC, and trigger signal data from the RHICf detector front-end electronics.

\section rhicfrawhit_overview Overview

StRHICfRawHit stores the raw front-end output of the **RHICf very-forward calorimeter**
before energy calibration.  It holds per-channel ADC values for the GSO sampling plates
(in two gain ranges each, plus a delayed pedestal sample), GSO position bar ADCs,
TDC timing values, and CAD0/GPI0/GPI1 trigger words.

**Detector**: RHICf very-forward calorimeter (η > 6)  
**Stage**: Raw front-end electronics (pre-calibration)

\section rhicfrawhit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StRHICfRawHit
\endcode

Stored in \c StRHICfCollection.

\section rhicfrawhit_gain Gain Ranges

| \c range index | Name | Use |
|---------------|------|-----|
| 0 | Wide range | High-energy deposits |
| 1 | Narrow range | Low-energy / high sensitivity |

Pedestal is estimated from the delayed sample (\c mPlateADCDelay).

\section rhicfrawhit_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c UShort_t[2][16][2] | \c mPlateADC | Primary plate ADC [tower][plate][range] |
| \c UShort_t[2][16][2] | \c mPlateADCDelay | Delayed (pedestal) plate ADC |
| \c UShort_t[4][2][20] | \c mGSOSmallADC | Small-tower bar ADC [layer][xy][bar] |
| \c UShort_t[4][2][40] | \c mGSOLargeADC | Large-tower bar ADC [layer][xy][bar] |
| \c UInt_t[256] | \c mTDC | TDC timing values |
| \c UInt_t[5] | \c mCAD0 | CAD0 trigger words |
| \c UInt_t[19] | \c mGPI0 | GPI0 flag words |
| \c UInt_t[17] | \c mGPI1 | GPI1 flag words |

\section rhicfrawhit_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c getPlateADC(tower,plate,range) | Primary plate ADC |
| \c getPlateADCDelay(tower,plate,range) | Delayed (pedestal) plate ADC |
| \c getGSOBarADC(tower,layer,xy,bar) | GSO bar ADC |
| \c getTDC(idx) | TDC channel value |
| \c getCAD0/GPI0/GPI1(idx) | Trigger words |
| \c clear() | Reset all data to zero |

\section rhicfrawhit_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StRHICfRawHit* raw = rhicfColl->rawHit();
// Pedestal-subtract narrow range (range=1)
for (int plate = 0; plate < kRHICfNplate; ++plate) {
    int signal = raw->getPlateADC(0, plate, 1) - raw->getPlateADCDelay(0, plate, 1);
}
UShort_t barAdc = raw->getGSOBarADC(0, 0, 0, 0); // small tower, layer 0, x, bar 0
\endcode

\see StRHICfHit, StRHICfPoint, StRHICfCollection
*/
